{"language":"cn","values":[["/names/cn","斯莱泽"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名擅长囚禁敌人的战士，能够使生命值较低的敌人无法行动。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","战场上的尖叫尤为悦耳"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","Battlefield screams are the most exquisite."],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","痛苦会带来享受——我的享受"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","Pain is pleasure."],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","嘘，乖，别动……"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","Shh. Be good. Now, don't move..."],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","真是不堪入目……"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_i18n/en","Truly an... eyesore..."],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","下一次或许应该更残酷些？"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_i18n/en","I should show the enemy more cruelty next time."],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","想要折磨？还是解脱？这是同一种东西。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/cn","嗯？有什么请求吗？"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/cn","尽情的期待吧。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/cn","嗯？想试试？这可没那么容易。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","呵，真是不错的玩具……想试试吗？"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","还算有品味。"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","很安静，不错"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","有什么新玩具吗？"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","这种调味……有趣。"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","令人愉悦的节日氛围"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","那么，今夜共舞一曲？"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","嘈杂，但颇有氛围"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","那么，去欣赏焰火吧"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","斯莱泽的眼罩有不同材质和款式，他每天都会细心挑选——尽管在外人看来好像都是黑色的。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","大约有五个仆从负责每天为斯莱泽打理他的头发。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","斯莱泽经受过相当严格的礼仪指导，据说连嘴角笑容的弧度都永远不会发生偏差。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","斯莱泽的剑可以像鞭子一样柔软灵活，但他更愿意认为，自己的鞭子拥有剑一样的锋刃。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","斯莱泽总是轻声细语，据说只有在战场上，他才会偶尔爆发出喜悦的狂笑。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","每天下午三点，是斯莱泽固定的下午茶时间——通常是针对一些不听话的小家伙的二十下鞭笞。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","和大部分亡灵不同，斯莱泽喜欢滚烫的茶水和重辣的口味，那种温度和痛楚总是让人愉快。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","作为亡灵的最好一点是，不需要无用的睡眠，可以有更多的时间来进行贵族的常态活动——社交和享乐。这也是斯莱泽的日常。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","在贵族中，斯莱泽属于相当勤勉的那一类——他通常每天花两个小时在工作上，如果事务繁杂，他会多加一小时的班。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","斯莱泽有许多宠物，包含许多种类，有活的，有死的，还有……嘘，你不会想知道的。"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","真是个不错的地方，要是有清静些的包厢就更好了。"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415018.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","瑟西娅 & 斯莱泽"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","很安静，不错"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415138.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","斯莱泽"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","这种调味……有趣。"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415139.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","斯莱泽"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","令人愉悦的节日氛围"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415453.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","斯莱泽"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/cn","那么，今夜共舞一曲？"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415454.json"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/cn","斯莱泽"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/cn","嘈杂，但颇有氛围"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415631.json"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/cn","斯莱泽"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/cn","那么，去欣赏焰火吧"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415632.json"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/cn","斯莱泽"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/cn","奈萨雷斯的残暴统治结束了，接下来的管理应当更温和一些。"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415659.json"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/cn","因度厄 & 斯莱泽"]]}